# Chat copy-paste

In Cursor chat, put shell commands and other copy-paste snippets on **one line**.

- Do not wrap with `\` or break flags onto following lines
- A fenced code block may contain several commands; each command is still one line
- Prefer a long line over a “pretty” multiline command

```bash
sweets config --bbox -155.02 19.44 -154.80 19.50 --start 2025-01-01 --end 2026-08-17 --source opera-cslc --track 124 --out-dir ./data --work-dir . --output sweets_config.yaml --overwrite
```
